<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Santa Isabel started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Santa Isabel started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of Santa Isabel SA and added the stock to its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Santa Isabel was unchanged at 24-5/8.</p>
</text>
